    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "to raise a girl is costlier than one would expect (like how a small bag can hold more than it seems)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「ああ、娘が大きくなるにつれて出費がかさむね。まさに小袋と小娘だよ。可愛いんだけどね。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "娘の教育費や習い事代を考えると、本当に小袋と小娘という言葉が身にしみる今日この頃だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "昔の人はよく言ったものだ、小袋と小娘。大切に育てれば育てるほど、お金がかかるものだね、と父が苦笑いした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "小袋と小娘は油斷がならぬとはよく云つたものだと、その時期が來れば、自然に花粉を呼ぶしくみになつてゐる人間の世界が隆吉には面白くもある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "崩浪亭主人",
                "author": "林芙美子",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "young women are fragile and great care must be taken with them (just as with small bags)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「お嬢さんは大切に扱わなければいけないよ。まるで小袋のように割れやすいものだから、小袋と小娘というからね。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「まったく、あの新人さんは繊細なんだから、もっと優しく接してあげなきゃ。小袋と小娘って言うじゃないか。」と先輩が言った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
